[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_1]
Operation <=Greenlight=> Report: Rabid Rhododendrons

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_1_desc]
Rabid Rhododendrons, a plant (or animal? It seems to have flexible mobility) that grows in the Everfree Forest. It is aggressive but weak. It can entangle or attack targets with thorns. Rabid Rhododendrons seem to have vision, but we have not found visual organs yet.

However, the special feature of Rabid Rhododendrons is that, during the hunting process, multiple Rabid Rhododendrons will surround the target and spray a special gas. This gas has a fragrance that can quickly put the target into a sleep state.

After investigation, Rabid Rhododendrons have indiscriminate attack and high cultivation costs. Thus it is not suitable for use as a weapon. However, the gas it produces can be collected and analyzed, and it is not ruled out that it may be used for war purposes in the future.

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_1_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_2]
Operation <=Greenlight=> Report: Rabid Rhododendrons

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_2_desc]
Rabid Rhododendrons, a plant (or animal? It seems to have flexible mobility) that grows in the Everfree Forest. It is aggressive but weak. It can entangle or attack targets with thorns. Rabid Rhododendrons seem to have vision, but we have not found visual organs yet.

However, the special feature of Rabid Rhododendrons is that, during the hunting process, multiple Rabid Rhododendrons will surround the target and spray a special gas. This gas has a fragrance that can quickly put the target into a sleep state.

After investigation, Rabid Rhododendrons have indiscriminate attack and high cultivation costs. Thus it is not suitable for use as a weapon. However, the gas it produces can be collected and analyzed, and it is not ruled out that it may be used for war purposes in the future.

§RAdditional Note: The gas, in addition to its hypnotic effect, is extremely flammable and explosive. Please be aware of open flames and cigarette butts.§!

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_2_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_3]
Operation <=Greenlight=> Report: Fire Safety Expert Group

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_3_desc]
The Ministry of Finance and the Ministry of Energy have hoarded excess oil, so we can now kill two birds with one stone: send those oil to Ponyville in the name of the Empress, and build fuel silos in Ponyville. At the same time, we can take this opportunity to infiltrate Ponyville at various stages, such as the construction team of the fuel silo, routine maintenance staffs, fire safety experts, fuel transportation team, fuel storage experts, security guards, fuel salesponies, etc. These employees will live in Ponyville for a long time and promote or oppose individual candidates according to the Empire’s preferences, so as to influence the political direction of Ponyville.

After the fuel silo is completed, we can also overstate the price of the fuel silo, so as to charge Ponyville for the oil at a high price. In this way, we not only establish an intelligence network in Ponyville, but also profit from it.

§RAdditional Note: Due to the accidental death of the group leader of this plan in an explosion, the next phase will be taken over by the leader of Group A.§!

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_3_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_4]
Operation <=Greenlight=> Report: Fire Safety Expert Group

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_4_desc]
The Ministry of Finance and the Ministry of Energy have hoarded excess oil, so we can now kill two birds with one stone: send those oil to Ponyville in the name of the Empress, and build fuel silos in Ponyville. At the same time, we can take this opportunity to infiltrate Ponyville at various stages, such as the construction team of the fuel silo, routine maintenance staffs, fire safety experts, fuel transportation team, fuel storage experts, security guards, fuel salesponies, etc. These employees will live in Ponyville for a long time and promote or oppose individual candidates according to the Empire’s preferences, so as to influence the political direction of Ponyville.

After the fuel silo is completed, we can also overstate the price of the fuel silo, so as to charge Ponyville for the oil at a high price. In this way, we not only establish an intelligence network in Ponyville, but also profit from it.

§RAdditional Note: Due to the accidental death of the group leader of this plan in an explosion, the next phase will be taken over by the leader of Group A.§!

Now, there are 17 fuel silos in the Duchy of Ponyville, scattered throughout Ponyville, Sweet Apple Acres, and other areas, each with a permanent fire safety team, which means that we have influence over all these areas. At the same time, Canterlot Luxury Perfume has also established many sales outlets in Ponyville. Most of the fire safety team and perfume shop staff are members of the EEMO or third parties with interests related to the Empire, and they will live in Ponyville for a long time to influence the political direction of Ponyville. We can already see the initial trend of the decline in Ponyville’s independence.

Currently, our preferred candidates are Filthy Rich and Mare. The former only needs money to make him easily loyal to the Empire, but maybe we can’t offer a higher price than Las Pegasus. The latter is already an old friend of ours. When you give a drowning pony a second chance, she will definitely grab it tightly and never let go. Although she believes in democracy and harmony... Emmm... “old harmony”, rather than the Empress’s neo-harmonism, Mare’s weakness will be our opportunity.

[en.EVENT_C01_C02_GREENLIGHT_4_o0]
Okay

