BBBBBBBBBB: Ponyville Plush Toy Company Headquarters
BGRGRGYRBR: Ponyville Day Spa
BGRGRGYRBY: Ponyville Police Station
BGRGRRGRBR: Ponyville Quills and Sofas
BGRGRRYRBY: Ponyville Train Station
BGRRRGYRBR: Ponyville Theater
BGRYRRYRBY: Ponyville Post Office
